### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health

### Subscribe Valid Email
POST http://localhost:5000/api/subscribers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "burrisai42@gmail.com"
}

### Subscribe Duplicate Email (Run the valid request twice to trigger this response)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/subscribers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "burrisai42@gmail.com"
}

### Subscribe Invalid Email (Validation error)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/subscribers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "invalid-email-address"
}

